{"id":"614406","name":"生菜饭包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/614406/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大米","amount":"100g"},{"name":"小土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"卷心菜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"熟肉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"小许"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大米淘洗干净，当适量清水浸泡1小时。","img":"images/614406/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净放泡好的大米里。","img":"images/614406/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放锅里。","img":"images/614406/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸熟。","img":"images/614406/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜和卷心菜切丁。","img":"images/614406/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜苗叶和熟肉切丁。","img":"images/614406/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放卷心菜胡萝卜翻炒。","img":"images/614406/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放食盐和甜面酱。","img":"images/614406/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒均匀。","img":"images/614406/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放蒜苗及肉丁。","img":"images/614406/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒均匀关火。","img":"images/614406/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放米饭和土豆。","img":"images/614406/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/614406/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取生菜。","img":"images/614406/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/614406/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"铺在保鲜膜上。","img":"images/614406/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放拌好的米饭。","img":"images/614406/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/614406/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/614406/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/614406/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/614406/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}